WEBVTT

00:00:07.290 --> 00:00:08.760
Beyblade...

00:00:08.760 --> 00:00:12.310
The world's most enjoyable battling top game!

00:00:12.310 --> 00:00:14.310
The beys shot from their launchers,

00:00:14.310 --> 00:00:18.360
and the Bladers' passions 
all collide in the stadium!

00:00:22.130 --> 00:00:23.810
Beyblade Burst is...

00:00:23.810 --> 00:00:28.430
...the story of the kids who do battle, 
entrusting their dreams to their Beys.

00:00:31.690 --> 00:00:35.690
{＜バルト：最強のチーム
ライドアウトとの団体戦　決勝。}For the team competition finals,
 we're against Rideout, a really strong team.

00:00:36.220 --> 00:00:38.890
{ファーストバトルは　クミチョーがバッチシ勝った。}Honcho won the first battle pretty easily.

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:42.890
{セカンドバトルは惜しくもダイナが負けちまった}Unfortunately, Daina lost in the second battle.

00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:46.130
{そして　サードバトルは　シュウの勝ちだ。}And Shu won the third battle.

00:00:46.580 --> 00:00:47.820
{ここまで　３対１}Now it's 3 points to 1.

00:00:48.260 --> 00:00:50.710
{俺たち　米駒学園がリードしてる＞}And the Beigoma Academy is in the lead.

00:00:51.150 --> 00:00:52.220
{（シンキ）なんなんだ}What just happened?

00:00:52.800 --> 00:00:54.750
{こんなやつに
どうやって勝てば…。 }How could this guy win...?

00:00:54.980 --> 00:00:57.330
{（ルイ）だったら消えろ。　目障りだ！}Get out of here. You're an eyesore!

00:01:00.350 --> 00:01:02.530
When the third battle ended...

00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:04.580
that guy appeared.

00:01:06.220 --> 00:01:06.660
{ルイ。}Lui.

00:01:07.240 --> 00:01:08.660
{（ルイ）聞こえなかったのか？}Didn't you hear me?

00:01:08.840 --> 00:01:09.480
{え？}Huh?

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:12.260
{消えろ。}Get out.

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:14.930
{お前にライドアウトの資格はない。}You don't have what it takes to be in Rideout.

00:01:16.930 --> 00:01:20.530
{お前のような　ダメなブレーダーはな！}Not a terrible blader like you!

00:01:31.210 --> 00:01:33.800
<i>Beyblade! Let's go</i>

00:01:31.210 --> 00:01:33.800
<i>Beyblade! Hajimeyou</i>

00:01:33.800 --> 00:01:39.560
<i>Become the ultimate Blader</i>

00:01:33.800 --> 00:01:39.560
<i>mezasou ze, saikyou no blader</i>

00:01:39.560 --> 00:01:44.560
<i>(Go! Burst! Go! Burst! Go! Burst! Beyblade Burst!)</i>

00:01:39.560 --> 00:01:44.560
<i>(Go! Burst! Go! Burst! Go! Burst! Beyblade Burst!)</i>

00:01:44.560 --> 00:01:49.860
<i>(Go! Burst! Go! Burst! Go! Go! Go! Burst!)</i>

00:01:44.560 --> 00:01:49.860
<i>(Go! Burst! Go! Burst! Go! Go! Go! Burst!)</i>

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:54.200
<i>Yeah, everyone's got it</i>

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:54.200
<i>kitto, dare datte mottenda</i>

00:01:54.200 --> 00:02:01.080
<i>The desire to win... and a Beyblade just for them!</i>

00:01:54.200 --> 00:02:01.080
<i>kachitaitte kanjou to... kimi dake no beibureedo!</i>

00:02:01.080 --> 00:02:04.370
<i>That's right, facing each other now</i>

00:02:01.080 --> 00:02:04.370
<i>sou, mukiatta hyoujou ni</i>

00:02:04.370 --> 00:02:11.090
<i>The will to become stronger starts boiling up, right?</i>

00:02:04.370 --> 00:02:11.090
<i>tsuyoku naritaitte kimochi ga hora, uzumaitendarou?</i>

00:02:11.090 --> 00:02:17.010
<i>Shoot! The throbbing of your spinning dreams (Burst!)</i>

00:02:11.090 --> 00:02:17.010
<i>SHOOT! mawari dashita yume no kodou</i>

00:02:17.010 --> 00:02:21.520
<i>Burn (Burst!) strong (Burst!), your hearts pound</i>

00:02:17.010 --> 00:02:21.520
<i>atsuku hajike, takanariau</i>

00:02:21.520 --> 00:02:23.560
<i>(3, 2, 1! Go Shoot!)</i>

00:02:21.520 --> 00:02:23.560
<i>(3, 2, 1! Go Shoot!)</i>

